===Etymology 1===
Ultimately from {{bor|en|la|Leo}} and {{m|la|leo||[[lion]]}}, from {{der|en|grc|Λέων}} and {{m|grc|λέων||[[lion]]}}, likely ultimately from a non-Indo-European language. Sometimes via other related languages such as {{der|en|fr|Léon}} and sometimes as a diminutive of related names such as {{m|en|Leonard}} and {{m|en|Leonardo}}. 

