===Statistics===
According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Leon'' is the 363<sup>rd</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 86,363 individuals. ''Leon'' is most common among Hispanic/Latino (85.21%) and White (9.99%) individuals.

